      "reason": "Drops the never-populated ai_credit_entitlements table and the unused ai_credit_holds.ai_credit_entitlement_uuid column with its partial unique index. Releases from 2.388.0 onward neither read nor write them, so a rolling upgrade from 2.388.0 or later is unaffected. An instance upgrading straight from 2.381.0 through 2.387.x must use the Recreate strategy: those releases still query ai_credit_entitlements from the AI usage sink, so their pods would fail to record AI usage once the table is gone.",
